<https://w3id.org/smtg/id/oracle-card/dcbcbf42-4654-487a-acad-21f2606d229b/face/0/oracle-text/fc7be5376bfa> smtg:textValue "(Gain the next level as a sorcery to add its ability.)\nLandfall — Whenever a land you control enters, you gain 1 life.\n{2}{G}: Level 2\nYou may play an additional land on each of your turns.\n{4}{G}: Level 3\nWhen this Class becomes level 3, target land you control becomes a creature with haste and \"This creature's power and toughness are each equal to the number of lands you control.\" It's still a land."@en;
